FIX 2: MATCHED-EPISODE PERMUTATION (100k iterations)
==========================================================================================
Two null models, both using ≥60 CALENDAR day gaps (not trading days):
  (a) Random dates with ≥60 calendar-day spacing
  (b) Fixed-gap translation (not a circular bootstrap) (preserve real inter-episode gaps)

